{"unit_id":"AcidGr__dsh-web-lan-access#card-zh","repo":"AcidGr/dsh-web-lan-access","commit":"00d9ded99bfc9f86e890f73efb17a2194e9290ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-lan-access 为 DSH Web 提供局域网和远程访问。bundle patch 用支持通配绑定的服务替代内置 webserver，并注入 Host ownership bootstrap。它可监听所有网卡、从非内部 IPv4 生成 trustedHosts、让远程页面使用 Host 设置，并为通配监听生成可拨号的 origin。适合从局域网、Tailscale 或 VPN 访问 DSH Web；无需 API key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:42-64","lib/webserver.js:84-101","lib/webserver.js:120-148","lib/index.js:27-59"]}
{"unit_id":"AcidGr__dsh-web-lan-access#card-en","repo":"AcidGr/dsh-web-lan-access","commit":"00d9ded99bfc9f86e890f73efb17a2194e9290ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-lan-access lets you reach DSH Web over LAN, Tailscale, or VPN. Its patch mounts a wildcard-capable webserver, trusts active non-internal IPv4 addresses, injects a Host ownership bootstrap, and maps wildcard origins to loopback. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:42-64","lib/webserver.js:84-101","lib/webserver.js:120-148","lib/index.js:27-59"]}
