{"unit_id":"AcidGr__dsh-web-lan-access#feature-wildcard-webserver","repo":"AcidGr/dsh-web-lan-access","commit":"00d9ded99bfc9f86e890f73efb17a2194e9290ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-lan-access 的功能「通配绑定」：替代内置 webserver，允许绑定 0.0.0.0 或 ::，并保留原 schema 的其余校验。端口和 TLS 配置仍由启动参数提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:42-56","lib/webserver.js:74-101"]}
